ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Claiborne County has come in under 90% of normal 37 times in 75 years in both August to September and October to November. In 2025 the middle ran 40% of normal in November to December and 142% in May to June. So far in 2026 it sat at 40% in February to March, then 165% in May to June. Grid 14558 had its driest year in 1952 at 62%.</p>"}
